        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (60–80 words).** Write a dialogue in a clothes shop: size, colour, trying it on, and deciding.\n\n**Speak (about 1 minute).** Play the customer aloud: ask for another size, say how it fits and ask about returning it."
